      "content": "stop participating in it altogether... that’s a heavy thought. it does feel like that sometimes. like the only way to actually find any quiet or peace is to just... stop existing in the middle of it all. like the noise just finally goes silent. is that weird to think about? that just not being here anymore might be the only way to actually find some rest?",
